🟡 Task search sends dual `task_id`+`title` params from a single search input. Backend uses AND semantics — searching "T3" requires BOTH task_name CONTAINS "T3" AND title CONTAINS "T3", which breaks task-name searches. Fix: send only `task_id` from the task mode search box (per spec identifier contract). See full narrative in PR comment.
ENDBODY
)

